title: Dell PowerVault ME5: Sensors
agents: dell_powervault_me5
catalog: hw/storagehw/dell
license: GPLv2
distribution: Sher Zaman
description:
 Monitors the power-supply electrical sensors of a Dell PowerVault ME5 system,
 grouped by sensor type (voltage and current). One service is created per type
 and aggregates every sensor of that type: the service reports the worst state
 across its members and names any sensor that is not OK, with all readings
 shown in the service details.

 The supercapacitor sensors are covered by the "Dell PowerVault ME5:
 Supercapacitor" check, and the enclosure status roll-up by the enclosure check.

 The mapping of the not-OK condition is configurable via the "Dell PowerVault
 ME5 sensor" ruleset.

item:
 The sensor type (for example {"Voltage"} or {"Current"}).

discovery:
 One service is created per power-supply sensor type present.
